 0px;\">\n           ‍\n          </span>\n</span>\n</section>\n<p style=\"text-align: center;\">\n<img src=\"https://mmbiz.qpic.cn/sz_mmbiz_jpg/Gr457cyFia7SwohlcAHRJiaOV3WnzWmTcasoNyTNxPRGtU5iaM779yBseOwSicERyzGXEk3sju3bc0sqNlqJp2pPDA/640?wx_fmt=jpeg&amp;from=appmsg\"/>\n</p>\n<section powered-by=\"werss\" style=\"line-height: 1.75em;margin-bottom: 0px;margin-top: 0px;\">\n<span style=\"font-size: 14px;\">\n</span>\n</section>\n<section powered-by=\"werss\" style=\"line-height: 1.75em;margin-bottom: 0px;margin-top: 0px;\">\n<span style=\"font-size: 14px;\">\n          这10只...umm...NICE！\n          <span style=\"display: none;line-height: 0px;\">\n           ‍\n          </span>\n<span style=\"display: none;line-height: 0px;\">\n           ‍\n          </span>\n<span style=\"display: none;line-height: 0px;\">\n           ‍\n          </span>\n<span style=\"display: none;line-height: 0px;\">\n           ‍\n          </span>\n<span style=\"display: none;line-height: 0px;\">\n           ‍\n          </span>\n<span style=\"display: none;line-height: 0px;\">\n           ‍\n          </span>\n<span style=\"display: none;line-height: 0px;\">\n           ‍\n          </span>\n<span style=\"display: none;line-height: 0px;\">\n           ‍\n          </span>\n<span style=\"display: none;line-height: 0px;\">\n</span>\n</span>\n</section>\n<section powered-by=\"werss\" style=\"line-height: 1.75em;margin-bottom: 0px;margin-top: 0px;\">\n<span style=\"font-size: 14px;\">\n          巴拿马这只被我们雪藏了两个月，数量也不多，还很实惠～别看它是23产季的，风味在线，好喝！\n          <span style=\"display: none;line-height: 0px;\">\n           ‍\n          </span>\n<span style=\"display: none;line-height: 0px;\">\n           ‍\n          </span>\n<span style=\"display: none;line-height: 0px;\">\n           ‍\n          </span>\n<span style=\"display: none;line-height: 0px;\">\n           ‍\n          </span>\n<span style=\"display: none;line-height: 0px;\">\n           ‍\n          </span>\n<span style=\"display: none;line-height: 0px;\">\n           ‍\n          </span>\n<span style=\"display: none;line-height: 0px;\">\n           ‍\n          </span>\n<span style=\"display: none;line-height: 0px;\">\n           ‍\n          </span>\n<span style=\"display: none;line-height: 0px;\">\n           ‍\n          </span>\n<span style=\"display: none;line-height: 0px;\">\n           ‍\n          </span>\n<span style=\"display: none;line-height: 0px;\">\n           ‍\n          </span>\n<span style=\"display: none;line-height: 0px;\">\n           ‍\n          </span>\n<span style=\"display: none;line-height: 0px;\">\n           ‍\n          </span>\n<span style=\"display: none;line-height: 0px;\">\n           ‍\n          </span>\n<span style=\"display: none;line-height: 0px;\">\n           ‍\n          </span>\n<span style=\"display: none;line-height: 0px;\">\n           ‍\n          </span>\n<span style=\"display: none;line-height: 0px;\">\n           ‍\n          </span>\n<span style=\"display: none;line-height: 0px;\">\n           ‍\n          </span>\n<span style=\"display: none;line-height: 0px;\">\n</span>\n</span>\n</section>\n<section powered-by=\"werss\" style=\"line-height: 1.75em;margin-bottom: 0px;margin-top: 0px;\">\n<span style=\"font-size: 14px;\">\n          3只肯尼亚风味调性也是蛮有差异的，红色深色莓果调最足的事Kiangai，柑橘调优于莓果的是Kii，而Kiaragana会突然给你一个奶奶的哈密瓜甜香气～然后还很建议三个混合起来三拼（当然分享包里的数量不一定够除非你12g冲泡的话就正好了），3合一后是我最喜欢的形态！\n          <span style=\"display: none;line-height: 0px;\">\n           ‍\n          </span>\n<span style=\"display: none;line-height: 0px;\">\n           ‍\n          </span>\n<span style=\"display: none;line-height: 0px;\">\n           ‍\n          </span>\n<span style=\"display: none;line-height: 0px;\">\n           ‍\n          </span>\n<span style=\"display: none;line-height: 0px;\">\n           ‍\n          </span>\n<span style=\"display: none;line-height: 0px;\">\n           ‍\n          </span>\n<span style=\"display: none;line-height: 0px;\">\n           ‍\n          </span>\n<span style=\"display: none;line-height: 0px;\">\n           ‍\n          </span>\n<span style=\"display: none;line-height: 0px;\">\n           ‍\n          </span>\n<span style=\"display: none;line-height: 0px;\">\n           ‍\n          </span>\n<span style=\"display: none;line-height: 0px;\">\n           ‍\n          </span>\n<span style=\"display: none;line-height: 0px;\">\n           ‍\n          </span>\n<span style=\"display: none;line-height: 0px;\">\n           ‍\n          </span>\n<span style=\"display: none;line-height: 0px;\">\n           ‍\n          </span>\n<span style=\"display: none;line-height: 0px;\">\n           ‍\n          </span>\n<span style=\"display: none;line-height: 0px;\">\n           ‍\n          </span>\n<span style=\"display: none;line-height: 0px;\">\n           ‍\n          </span>\n<span style=\"display: none;line-height: 0px;\">\n           ‍\n          </span>\n<span style=\"display: none;line-height: 0px;\">\n           ‍\n          </span>\n<span style=\"display: none;line-height: 0px;\">\n           ‍\n          </span>\n<span style=\"display: none;line-height: 0px;\">\n           ‍\n          </span>\n<span style=\"display: none;line-height: 0px;\">\n           ‍\n          </span>\n<span style=\"display: none;line-height: 0px;\">\n</span>\n</span>\n</section>\n<section powered-by=\"werss\" style=\"line-height: 1.75em;margin-bottom: 0px;margin-top: 0px;\">\n<span style=\"font-size: 14px;\">\n          佐园的瑰夏水洗，是新产季佐园瑰夏里但凡是测过的人都会喜欢的批次，干净，甜，好喝！豆子也比去年好看很多了，我们包装组的同事也不再那么头疼了，客服伙伴应该也会长出一口气了～\n          <span style=\"display: none;line-height: 0px;\">\n           ‍\n          </span>\n<span style=\"display: none;line-height: 0px;\">\n           ‍\n          </span>\n<span style=\"display: none;line-height: 0px;\">\n           ‍\n          </span>\n<span style=\"display: none;line-height: 0px;\">\n           ‍\n          </span>\n<span style=\"display: none;line-height: 0px;\">\n           ‍\n          </span>\n<span style=\"display: none;line-height: 0px;\">\n           ‍\n          </span>\n<span style=\"display: none;line-height: 0px;\">\n           ‍\n          </span>\n<span style=\"display: none;line-height: 0px;\">\n           ‍\n          </span>\n<span style=\"display: none;line-height: 0px;\">\n           ‍\n          </span>\n<span style=\"display: none;line-height: 0px;\">\n           ‍\n          </span>\n<span style=\"display: none;line-height: 0px;\">\n           ‍\n          </span>\n<span style=\"display: none;line-height: 0px;\">\n           ‍\n          </span>\n<span style=\"display: none;line-height: 0px;\">\n</span>\n</span>\n</section>\n<section powered-by=\"werss\" style=\"line-height: 1.75em;margin-bottom: 0px;margin-top: 0px;\">\n<span style=\"font-size: 14px;\">\n          埃塞甜！哥伦甜！\n         </span>\n</section>\n<section powered-by=\"werss\" style=\"line-height: 1.75em;margin-bottom: 0px;margin-top: 0px;\">\n<span style=\"font-size: 14px;\">\n          都很甜！\n          <span style=\"display: none;line-height: 0px;\">\n           ‍\n          </span>\n<span style=\"display: none;line-height: 0px;\">\n           ‍\n          </span>\n<span style=\"display: none;line-height: 0px;\">\n           ‍\n          </span>\n<span style=\"display: none;line-height: 0px;\">\n</span>\n</span>\n</section>\n<section powered-by=\"werss\" style=\"line-height: 1.75em;margin-bottom: 0px;margin-top: 0px;\">\n<span style=\"font-size: 14px;\">\n          注意：因为每一只组合里仅有1包，要多给他们一些养豆期，2周打底哈～能拉到3周开喝就更好了；肯尼亚3只喝1天；埃塞3只喝1天，哥伦和巴拿马，佐园四只瑰夏喝一天；拆分下也就最多一周也就喝完了；\n         </span>\n</section>\n<section powered-by=\"werss\" style=\"line-height: 1.75em;margin-bottom: 0px;margin-top: 0px;\">\n<br/>\n</section>\n<section powered-by=\"werss\" style='margin-bottom: 0px;white-space: normal;outline: 0px;font-family: system-ui, -apple-system, BlinkMacSystemFont, \"Helvetica Neue\", \"PingFang SC\", \"Hiragino Sans GB\", \"Microsoft YaHei UI\", \"Microsoft YaHei\", Arial, sans-serif;letter-spacing: 0.544px;color: rgb(34, 34